  <h1>A letter for you</h1>

  <article class="paper">
    <p class="to">Dear Gabriella,</p>
    <p>Happy 12th birthday!</p>
    <p>I made this little kingdom for you with my own hands, line by line, because you deserve something made just for you.</p>
    <p>You are growing up so fast, and I am proud of the person you are becoming: kind, clever and full of light.</p>
    <p>I want you to know a few things. You are loved. You are enough exactly as you are. And whatever you dream of becoming, I will always be cheering for you.</p>
    <p>Thank you for being my sister. Being your brother is one of the greatest gifts I have ever received.</p>
    <p>Now go and enjoy your day. You have earned it.</p>
    <p class="sign">With all my love,<br>your brother, Jordan</p>
  </article>

